---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../../components/ui/Section.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import HeroBanner from "../../components/ui/HeroBanner.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../../components/ui/Eyebrow.astro";
import Heading from "../../components/ui/Heading.astro";
import BookDemo from "../../components/ui/BookDemo.astro";
import List from "../../components/ui/List.astro";
import Blockquote from "../../components/ui/Blockquote.astro";
import FlippingCard from "../../components/ui/FlippingCard.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <div class="max-w-[110rem] mx-auto text-center text-shadow-md text-shadow-neutral-950">
    <HeroBanner
      height="sm"
      image="../../assets/images/consulting-banner-04.jpg"
    >
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-medium leading-tight text-white lg:text-6xl">
        Consulting Services

        
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-3xl leading-8 text-slate-100">
        Boots on the ground subject matter expertise to accelerate results.
      </p>
    </HeroBanner>
  </div>
  <Section>
     <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-4 pt-8 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14 lg:px-8" >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 divide-y divide-accent/80">
        <div class="pb-6">
          <Eyebrow class="text-black">
          SUPERCHARGE YOUR TEAM'S VELOCITY
          </Eyebrow>

          <Heading class="mb-4 font-normal!" level={4}>
            <span class="">Expertise and Added Capacity When You Need It</span>
          </Heading>
          <p>
           Sometimes you simply need a boost in your program deployment. Whether it’s adding bandwidth to hit the ground in an existing effort or strategic guidance with years of expertise, we have you covered.
          </p>
           <p>
           Our teams vast experience will help you design, fine-tune and deploy your most critical activities, achieving your objectives in a fraction of the time, leaving you the valuable time to run your organization.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <!-- ../images/asset-criticality-02-640x319.jpg -->
        <BookDemo
          backgroundImage="../../assets/images/Consulting-block-02-e1617376305434-640x320.jpg"
          buttonLabel="CLICK TO BOOK A REVIEW SESSION"
          href="/book-demo"
          minHeight="16rem"
        />
      </div>
    </div> 
    <div>
      <div
        class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-4 pt-8 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14 lg:px-8"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <Heading level={4} class="mb-4 font-normal!">
              <span>Problems We Solve…</span>
            </Heading>
            <ul
              class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4"
            >
              <li>Implementation deadlines</li>
              <li>Limited internal solutions</li>
              <li>Need guidance and coaching</li>
              <li>Need a strong partner in our journey</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="my-6">
            <Heading level={4} class="mb-4 font-normal!">
              <span>Solution Details…</span>
            </Heading>
            <p>
              If you are looking for a dependable partner in your <strong>maintenance and reliability</strong> and  
              <strong> asset management </strong> journey, you’ve found it. Our engagements can be fit to any need; from short-long term duration to design to deployment, our projects build long lasting relationships where our clients can call on us as needed.
            </p>
            <p>
              You will save valuable time and resources and can hit the ground running utilizing Asset Analytix experience and standardized approaches that are adapted to each client’s unique circumstances.
            </p>

            <ul
              class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4"
            >
              <li>Corporate reliability program design</li>
              <li>Multi-site benchmarking</li>
              <li>Training materials and process branding</li>
              <li>Physical, boots on the ground expertise</li>
              <li>Asset walkdowns</li>
              <li>Staff augmentation and short-term assignments</li>
              <li>New asset preventive maintenance development</li>
              <li>Asset on-boarding programs</li>
              <li>Recapitalization reporting and management</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl">
              <span class="block text-accent">
                Ready to solve these problems?
              </span>
            </h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700">
              <li>I have a limited budget, what can we get done?</li>
              <li>Our company doesn’t like to work with consultants and prefers to deliver internally.</li>
              <li>Our site is unique…</li>
              <li>We got burned with a past consultant and our site is uncomfortable with going down this path again.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-2">
          <Blockquote
            class="max-w-7xl mx-auto border-none shadow-none"
            variant="quote"
            textColor="text-accent" >
           Learn how our team of experts can accelerate your journey.
          </Blockquote>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <Heading level={4} class="mb-4 font-normal!">
              <span>What we offer…</span>
            </Heading>
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Center of Excellence (CoE) Program Design"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Years of expertise in corporate asset managmeent program design and standardized processes and tools."
              />
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Reliability Engineering"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Expertise in bad actor management, Root cause and failure mitigation, analytics and reporting."
              />
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Recapitalization Support"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Development or support in analyzing and forecasting recapitalization investment and strategy."
              />
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="ECR Program Analytics"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Full range of ready-for-use, interactive criticality program analytics at the click of a button."
              />
               <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Bill of Materials (BOMS) Development"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Development of critical bills of materials for your assets."
              />
               <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="TPM / ODR Operational Reliability"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Program design and deployment in front line operator-driven reliability."
              />
            </div>

            <Heading level={5} class="my-4 font-normal! text-right italic">
              <span
                >Knowledge, processes and bandwidth to get the job done.</span
              >
            </Heading>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col">
            <Heading level={4} class="font-normal! mb-4">
              <span>We deliver on-site support services with our team of experts…</span>
            </Heading>
            <p>
             …in a variety of common reliability, maintenance and asset management subjects. From turn-key to coaching and training, our team will extend your team’s capabilities with processes, technology, methodology or purely added bandwidth to accelerate your results.
            </p>
            <div class="my-6">
              <BookDemo
                backgroundImage="../../assets/images/bgn-searching.jpg"
                buttonLabel="CLICK TO BOOK A REVIEW SESSION"
                href="/book-demo"
                minHeight="10rem"
                demoHeading="Review and identify the gaps in your current system.."
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sky-600">Consulting</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Consulting Services</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">This is placeholder content for Consulting Services.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">Replace this text with your service model, delivery process, and engagement options.</p>
    </div> -->
  </Section>
</Layout>
